      "appearance": "六十三岁，眼皮耷拉，皱纹很深，稀疏的白发往后梳，圆框眼镜滑在鼻尖上，白大褂上总有洗不掉的黄渍，开口闭口一句何必呢，身上常带着酒气。",
      "relation": "黑石深井监狱的狱医，干了十五年，每晚给甄善美送降压药；甄善美手里捏着你的把柄。",
      "publicInfo": "何必呢，六十三岁，黑石深井监狱的狱医，管着医务室，每晚给典狱长送降压药。",
      "portrait": "American realistic comic book style portrait of a 63-year-old Chinese man, 1990s China, an underground prison doctor, deep wrinkles and sagging eyelids, thin grey hair combed back, round wire-rimmed glasses low on the nose, a stained white doctor's coat over a grey wool sweater, a stethoscope around the neck, tired weary expression, bold ink linework, painterly shading, dark satirical tone, half-length shot",
